<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">SP01 云存储权限检查</view>
    <view class="subtitle">只操作一份随机合成测试文件，不含真实用户资料。此工具不会修改权限设置。</view>
    <view class="hint warn">第二账号先核对身份摘要。摘要相同会停止；摘要不同后才测试读取与同路径写入。</view>
    <button class="button button-secondary" hover-class="button-hover" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="checkIdentityOnly" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">仅诊断身份调用（不写文件）</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">账号 A：创建者</view>
    <view class="hint">生成共享测试码后，查询当前微信身份摘要并上传一份合成文件。完成后把下方测试包发给账号 B。</view>
    <button class="button button-secondary" hover-class="button-hover" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="generateNonce" disabled="{{busy}}">生成共享测试码</button>
    <text class="field-label">共享测试码</text>
    <view class="field-value">{{nonce || '点击上方按钮生成'}}</view>
    <button class="button button-primary" hover-class="button-hover" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="createOwnerFile" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">查询身份并创建合成文件</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">账号 B：其他用户</view>
    <view class="hint">粘贴账号 A 生成的完整测试包。运行时会重新从云函数读取 B 的当前身份；不会使用手填身份。</view>
    <text class="field-label">账号 A 的测试包</text>
    <textarea value="{{bundleText}}" bindinput="onBundleInput" maxlength="1800" placeholder="粘贴 A 复制的 JSON 测试包" />
    <button class="button button-secondary" hover-class="button-hover" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="loadBundle" disabled="{{busy}}">检查测试包</button>
    <button class="button button-primary" hover-class="button-hover" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="runOtherProbe" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">核对身份并测试读取 / 写入</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">回到账号 A：核验与清理</view>
    <view class="hint">账号 B 完成后，A 可核验原文件是否仍匹配，然后只删除测试包中的确切 fileID。</view>
    <button class="button button-secondary" hover-class="button-hover" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="verifyOwnerFile" disabled="{{busy}}">核验创建者文件</button>
    <button class="button button-danger" hover-class="button-hover" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="cleanupOwnerFile" disabled="{{busy}}">删除这份合成测试文件</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{bundleText}}" class="card">
    <view class="section-title">测试包</view>
    <view class="report">{{bundleText}}</view>
    <button class="button button-secondary" hover-class="button-hover" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="copyBundle" disabled="{{busy}}">复制测试包</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{report}}" class="card">
    <view class="section-title">本机结果</view>
    <view class="report">{{report}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="hint">分享前只复制测试包，不要转发开发者工具日志。包内仅有随机测试码、短身份摘要、测试文件 ID、路径和合成证明文本。</view>
</view>
